  "definition": "PORS Maintenance Schedules",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-07-24",
  "historyNote": "#9572, INTERIM, eff 10-21-09, EXPIRES: 4-19-10; ss by #9660, eff 2-24-10; ss by #12582, eff 7-24-18",
